    {
      "source": "The subject of an insert, described by the entity instance and its <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a>, where identifier contains\ninformation about data that needs to be considered for the insert but which is not part of the entity. Namely\nreferences back to a parent entity and key/index columns for entities that are stored in a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>.",
      "translation": "插入的主体由其实例及其 <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a> 描述，其中标识符包含需要在插入时考虑但并非实体一部分的数据信息。具体而言，这些包括对父实体的引用，以及存储在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a> 或\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>List</code></a> 中的实体的键/索引列。",
      "count": 1
    },
